OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FRemaining
OL,6,Fbreezy with showers, some heavy with a
OL,7,Frisk of hail this evening. Showers
OL,8,Feasing from the west overnight, the
OL,9,Fregion becoming mostly dry although it
OL,10,Fwill remain rather cloudy by dawn.
OL,11,
OL,12,CMonday:FEarly cloud breaking to sunny
OL,13,Fspells. Breezy with scattered showers
OL,14,Faround lunchtime, mostly light.
OL,15,FShowers slowly fading from the west
OL,16,Fduring the afternoon, with winds
OL,17,Ffalling lighter through the evening.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
